{"source": "runs/2026-10-20T20-26-22_qwen36-gpu1_97a0/events.jsonl (state events turns 714-717 and the gym guide page at seq 28035, slimmed to the fields the folds read)", "events": [{"v": 1, "run": "2026-10-20T20-26-22_qwen36-gpu1_97a0", "seq": 28035, "t": "2026-10-20T22:25:35.712-04:00", "type": "dialogue_auto_advance", "turn": 630, "tool_call_id": "obZ1qVntY3lkXtwJ0y9LM52G9JqjvCP6", "tool": "navigate_to_target", "requested": [], "sent": [], "dropped": [], "auto_presses": 12, "stop": "field_free", "detail": "the conversation closed and field controls are free", "duration_ms": 16318, "pages": [{"state_seq": 27964, "map": "RUSTBORO CITY GYM", "map_id": [11, 3], "text": "Yo, how's it going?", "speaker": "MAN_2", "speaker_source": "faced_sprite", "position": {"x": 3, "y": 17}}, {"state_seq": 27970, "map": "RUSTBORO CITY GYM", "map_id": [11, 3], "text": "Listen, my friend!\nWould you like to become the CHAMPION?", "speaker": "MAN_2", "speaker_source": "faced_sprite", "position": {"x": 3, "y": 17}}, {"state_seq": 27976, "map": "RUSTBORO CITY GYM", "map_id": [11, 3], "text": "I'm no TRAINER, not me, but I can\nsure give you winning advice.", "speaker": "MAN_2", "speaker_source": "faced_sprite", "position": {"x": 3, "y": 17}}, {"state_seq": 27982, "map": "RUSTBORO CITY GYM", "map_id": [11, 3], "text": "That's settled, then! We'll aim for the\nPOK\u00e9MON CHAMPIONSHIP together!", "speaker": "MAN_2", "speaker_source": "faced_sprite", "position": {"x": 3, "y": 17}}, {"state_seq": 27988, "map": "RUSTBORO CITY GYM", "map_id": [11, 3], "text": "It's your job as a TRAINER to collect\nGYM BADGES, am I right?", "speaker": "MAN_2", "speaker_source": "faced_sprite", "position": {"x": 3, "y": 17}}, {"state_seq": 27994, "map": "RUSTBORO CITY GYM", "map_id": [11, 3], "text": "But GYM LEADERS aren't pushovers!", "speaker": "MAN_2", "speaker_source": "faced_sprite", "position": {"x": 3, "y": 17}}, {"state_seq": 28000, "map": "RUSTBORO CITY GYM", "map_id": [11, 3], "text": "And that's where I come in!\nI'm here to provide expert advice!", "speaker": "MAN_2", "speaker_source": "faced_sprite", "position": {"x": 3, "y": 17}}, {"state_seq": 28006, "map": "RUSTBORO CITY GYM", "map_id": [11, 3], "text": "ROXANNE, the GYM LEADER, is a user\nof ROCK-type POK\u00e9MON.", "speaker": "MAN_2", "speaker_source": "faced_sprite", "position": {"x": 3, "y": 17}}, {"state_seq": 28017, "map": "RUSTBORO CITY GYM", "map_id": [11, 3], "text": "The ROCK type is very durable, but\nit can't stand WATER-type and\nGRASS-type moves.", "speaker": "MAN_2", "speaker_source": "faced_sprite", "position": {"x": 3, "y": 17}}, {"state_seq": 28023, "map": "RUSTBORO CITY GYM", "map_id": [11, 3], "text": "Come see me afterwards, if you beat\nthe GYM LEADER.", "speaker": "MAN_2", "speaker_source": "faced_sprite", "position": {"x": 3, "y": 17}}, {"state_seq": 28029, "map": "RUSTBORO CITY GYM", "map_id": [11, 3], "text": "Well, go for it!", "speaker": "MAN_2", "speaker_source": "faced_sprite", "position": {"x": 3, "y": 17}}]}, {"v": 1, "run": "2026-10-20T20-26-22_qwen36-gpu1_97a0", "seq": 30092, "t": "2026-10-20T22:35:58.041-04:00", "type": "state", "turn": 714, "started": true, "screen": "overworld", "in_battle": false, "location": "RUSTBORO CITY GYM", "map_id": [11, 3], "trainer_opponent": {"trainer_id": 571, "trainer_class": 2, "name": "MARC", "defeated": true, "battle_active": false}, "blackout_active": false, "party": [{"species": "TORCHIC", "level": 15, "hp": 42, "max_hp": 42, "is_egg": false, "nickname": "TORCHIC"}], "battle": null}, {"v": 1, "run": "2026-10-20T20-26-22_qwen36-gpu1_97a0", "seq": 30096, "t": "2026-10-20T22:35:58.770-04:00", "type": "state", "turn": 714, "started": true, "screen": "overworld", "in_battle": false, "location": "RUSTBORO CITY GYM", "map_id": [11, 3], "trainer_opponent": {"trainer_id": 571, "trainer_class": 2, "name": "MARC", "defeated": true, "battle_active": false}, "blackout_active": false, "party": [{"species": "TORCHIC", "level": 15, "hp": 42, "max_h